  "sourceConditions": [
    {
      "id": "q12_solution",
      "condition": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABH}$에서 $\\overline{\\text{BH}}=4$, $\\angle\\text{B}=60^\\circ$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{AH}} = 4\\tan 60^\\circ = 4\\sqrt{3}, \\quad x = \\overline{\\text{AB}} = \\frac{4}{\\cos 60^\\circ} = 8$$ 직각삼각형 $\\text{AHC}$에서 $\\angle\\text{C}=45^\\circ$이므로 $$y = \\overline{\\text{AC}} = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AH}}}{\\sin 45^\\circ} = \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}} = 4\\sqrt{6}$$ 따라서 $x+y = 8+4\\sqrt{6}$이므로 정답은 ②이다.",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
  "sourceQuote": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABH}$에서 $\\overline{\\text{BH}}=4$, $\\angle\\text{B}=60^\\circ$이므로"
